<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-22T22:38:33.798Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:38:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed gangs continue attacks across central Nigeria, killing civilians in villages, a mining site in Plateau and a mosque in Niger state, while bandits threaten to block roads and levy fees in Zamfara ahead of the 2027 elections. Military personnel were accused of opening fire on civilians in Gombe, and gunmen in military uniforms killed a 60-year-old security guard in Plateau. ISWAP suffered a major loss with a Shura Council member and top commanders killed as troops repelled an attack in Borno. A funeral-bound boat capsized in southern Nigeria, killing at least 24 people. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQZG5kNWlmcEZkU1FwejJfVUlPR3hKT3NqSngzMXBncG01NjhoUl9xUGs5V19yWGs5WDFJaE9qV01tZTM3aVZpOE5FOEVLQ1lCbDRSX0VXU1F4aVFjTUdJT1UyV0hTOFZtTzNvVFI1cnFWdnJFNWJLZGlDakFUVW1ZWkxKUkNZYVhVSEN5dDc3WXlqaGs0Q3d2QzdUUmR6QzlCTDhIeWVGT2VyZHRHODFGQWl1R0lidw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE5tSFBoa05VVlBmV0kxbkpCbjJHVG9mcl9vTS14UVhYSmNYRWNvV2ZlMVA0Qzl3WWV3YzBQSU03bGotY0RoalVFTVduY2pVZEZXNjRF?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPVktSRjJ0UUNfaDBzc3J1SmFtcE5mMWFMVjAta0NFWE9xeGdGYnA5YTJSNnBBSUM1RWdmdjRwNkFpSDhxUFJyWnZXNW5zVDlsTk5KSWNNb1J0ZjFFR0NjdXB2NlhIUVozNmtCcGFmbTkxUk5BRjFOd2VhMHhtY1FZU1F6bHNidGtlc1BTUmNOck1VS3NDOVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPTVVSSkdwUURXQVRTQlI5THh4a1VTWnJSbmxkYzlJWnJIWGM4TG5uVVlUN1dCa1dFbGlYU1AzeTJFYkFnZmJ0U19PdlhtOGpCaDl6aHFYcG5LYXdJQ3NoUkNsWF9VN05kcUhOdV94Y0k4LVhDRFI0WFNwZzhEb2VudGNHWUMtbU1Xb0JNYXJQdWY0UEswS2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Independent Newspaper Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, 